<p>Hi <%= @user.first_name %>,</p>

<p>An account has been created for you on <%= MailBranding::NAME %> HRMS<%= " for #{@company_name}" if @company_name.present? && @company_name != MailBranding::NAME %>. Here are your sign-in details.</p>

<table cellpadding="8" cellspacing="0" style="border-collapse:collapse;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:8px;margin:16px 0">
  <tr>
    <td style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px">Email</td>
    <td style="font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:14px"><%= @user.email_address %></td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="color:#64748b;font-size:13px">Password</td>
    <td style="font-family:ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,monospace;font-size:16px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.5px"><%= @password %></td>
  </tr>
</table>

<%= mail_button "Sign in", @sign_in_url %>

<% if @must_change %>
  <p>This password works once. You will be asked to choose your own as soon as you sign in.</p>
<% else %>
  <p>You can keep using this password. If you would rather pick your own, you can change it at any time from Settings once you are signed in.</p>
<% end %>

<p>Because this password arrived by email, treat it as known to anyone who can read this mailbox. If you weren't expecting this, tell your administrator — they can issue a new one, which stops this password working immediately.</p>
